{"updated":"2026-10-11T23:01:51.226Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Politics live: Ryan ‘not bothered’ by possible Frydenberg return; Lambie accuses Labor of ‘financial coercion’ over FoI. Elsewhere, one killed, 11 injured in second Houthi strike on Riyadh airport in two days. And boy, 13, charged with murder after man stabbed to death in Sydney’s west. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 2.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 1.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 4.2 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 46 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.2 near 79 km SSE of Panguna, Papua New Guinea. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.13,0.19,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.36,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.55,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.69,0.8,0.89,1.07,1.35,1.46,1.51,1.54,1.57,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.68,1.73,1.78,1.85,1.9,1.95,1.99,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.14,2.19,2.25,2.3,2.33,2.38,2.43,2.47,2.52,2.57,2.61,2.68,2.75,2.87,2.96,3.08,3.1,3.15,3.18,3.23,3.27,3.33,3.42,3.51,3.56,3.63,3.68,3.73,3.77,3.82,3.87,3.89,3.91,3.97,3.99,4.02,4.04,4.09,4.13,4.21,4.27,4.33,4.4,4.46,4.57,4.61,4.67,4.69,4.75,4.87,5.02,5.19,5.7,5.77,5.84,5.91,5.97,6.03,6.11,6.17,6.21,6.28,6.34,6.46,6.51,6.66,6.78,7.11,7.2,7.35,7.42,7.46,7.5,7.52,7.57,7.63,7.67,7.73,7.77,7.85,7.91,7.93,7.96,7.99,8.05,8.07,8.09,8.14,8.2,8.26,8.32,8.37,8.42,8.47,8.52,8.58,8.63,8.67,8.72,8.77,8.81,8.88,8.94,9,9.04,9.09,9.15,9.21,9.25,9.31,9.39,9.43,9.48,9.57,9.68,9.75,9.87,10.02,10.3,10.38,10.49,10.55,10.62,10.68,10.73,10.76,10.82,10.87,10.94,11.03,11.1,11.19,11.23,11.3,11.34,11.44,11.49,11.54,11.57,11.63,11.67,11.7,11.75,11.77,11.82,11.91,11.97,12.04,12.1,12.15,12.2,12.25,12.28,12.34,12.39,12.54,12.61,12.67,12.74,12.